     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "<h3> Electrical Design Area </h3> <h1> PLC Programmer (m/f/d) </h1>",
      "body": "<p><a href=\"/fileadmin/01_Pages/Company/Career/DE/SPS_Programmierer_2026_06_02_ZOLLER.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Job Posting (PDF)</a></p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "textmedia",
      "id": "c97472",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<h4>Your Profile</h4><ul><li>Completed vocational training or a degree in the area of electrical engineering, automation technology, mechatronics, or comparable fields</li><li>Extensive experience with CODESYS and object-oriented PLC programming</li><li>Knowledge of C# and the .NET Framework, as well as the development of ASP.NET applications</li><li>Knowledge in the area of machine connection to IT systems (e.g., OPC UA, MQTT, REST)</li><li>Experience with industrial and transport robots</li><li>Knowledge of fieldbus systems (e.g., EtherCAT, Profinet)</li><li>A structured, solution-oriented approach to work</li><li>Willingness to travel occasionally</li><li>Good written<br/> and spoken German and English</li></ul><h4>Your Responsibilities</h4><ul><li>Development and implementation of PLC programs in CODESYS (IEC 61131-3)</li><li>Analysis, optimization, and extension of existing control systems</li><li>Taking responsibility for and overseeing products from the prototype stage through to series production</li><li>Conducting software tests</li><li>Application of object-oriented programming methods in automation technology</li><li>Commissioning of machines and systems both in-house and at customer sites</li><li>Preparing technical documentation</li><li>Working closely with the IT, electrical engineering, and project management<br/> teams</li></ul><h4>Location</h4> <p>Pleidelsheim, Germany.</p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
